## Local template blob store — never versioned. Registered templates are data, and in a
## deployed environment this path points at a mounted volume or object store, not the repo.
storage/

## Local secrets. Connection strings and any future JWT/service credentials belong in
## environment variables or the platform's secret store, never in a committed appsettings file.
appsettings.Local.json
*.env
.env

